MODULE: CoreStepRefinedTimerRefusalAsSweep
TARGET: CoreStepRefined
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a refused timer dispatch is booked as a refused sweep
PERTURBS: TimerDispatchDrive

--- FIND
       ELSE DriveRefused(l, "timer")
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: charge the sweep refusal window for a timer refusal.
       ELSE DriveRefused(l, "sweep")
--- END
